          "source_id": "s-shiji-067-disciples",
          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-067-disciples:p007",
          "quote": "魯哀公問：「弟子孰爲好學？」孔子對曰：「有顏回者好學，不遷怒，不貳過。不幸短命死矣，今也則亡。」",
          "person_mention_id": "c-shiji-067-disciples:m007-0021"
